# Charles University source artwork: the Illustrator file and print PDF the
# served emblem was traced from. Kept locally (and in Dropbox), out of the
# repository — this repo has to be public for Pages, and republishing the
# University's source art is a separate thing from using the emblem to show
# affiliation. Nothing on the site loads these; assets/img/cu-emblem.svg does
# all the work. See README, "The Charles University emblem".
assets/img/CUcoat/

# Original photographs. The site serves one derived crop,
